      "id": "claim_8c47e3fe2aca4ce79f9978224cb17f6f",
      "statement": "Each peer generates its own RSA-OAEP-2048 key pair when creating its outgoing artifact (offer link or answer code), holding the private key in page state; the receive page awaits the validated p-param import before generating the answer's pair. The receiver's RSA public key is imported from the counterparty's artifact with explicit try/catch validation.",
