      "statement": "Chunk-level encryption wraps the transfer framing: the sender encrypts each chunk buffer before Message-encoding it as a chunk, and the receiver decrypts each decoded chunk (only when isEncrypt and the per-file aesKey are both present), inside the per-file serialized processChunk task, before accumulating bytes toward the declared file size.",
