      "id": "claim_c5d863ce334a49c989924000c2fb6a3c",
      "statement": "Failure behavior is degraded-not-crashing: a missing per-file aesKey makes the sender fall back to sending that chunk plaintext, a malformed 'p' param downgrades isEncrypt to false with an error toast (the answer no longer advertises encryption), a malformed answer-code key aborts acceptance with an error toast, and encryption off means no keys are generated and all chunks are sent without crypto.",
